Form\">Scroll of Gaseous Form</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gaseous_Form\" title=\"Gaseous Form\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/45px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/60px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gaseous Form\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Gaseous_Form\" title=\"Gaseous Form\">Gaseous Form</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mist_Stance\" title=\"Mist Stance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/45px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/60px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mist Stance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mist_Stance\" title=\"Mist Stance\">Mist Stance</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Escape_(Vampire_Ascendant)\" title=\"Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/45px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/60px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Misty_Escape_(Vampire_Ascendant)\" title=\"Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)\">Misty Escape (Vampire Ascendant)</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ride_the_Winds\" title=\"Ride the Winds\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/45px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/60px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ride the Winds\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/Gaseous_Form_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ride_the_Winds\" title=\"Ride the Winds\">Ride the Winds</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wind_Walk\" title=\"Wind Walk\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Wind_Walk_Icon.webp/30px-Wind_Walk_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Wind_Walk_Icon.webp/45px-Wind_Walk_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Wind_Walk_Icon.webp/60px-Wind_Walk_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wind Walk\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Wind_Walk_Icon.webp/30px-Wind_Walk_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Wind_Walk_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Wind_Walk\" title=\"Wind Walk\">Wind Walk</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>GASEOUS_FORM</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Blinked_to_the_Ethereal_Plane_(Condition)\" title=\"Blinked to the Ethereal Plane (Condition)\">Blinked to the Ethereal Plane</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity is in the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ethereal_Plane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Plane\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Ethereal_Plane\">Ethereal Plane</a></span>, where it can't be harmed, seen, or affected.</li>\n<li>While in the Ethereal Plane, the entity can't move or interact with anything in the world. It can choose to teleport up to 6 m (20 ft).</li>\n<li>At the end of each turn, there is a chance it reappears in the Material Plane. When combat ends, so does this effect.</li>\n<li>Immune to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bleeding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleeding</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Gaseous_Form\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gaseous_Form_(Condition)\" title=\"Gaseous Form (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gaseous Form\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Gaseous_Form_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Gaseous Form</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Transformed into a cloud of mist.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Types#Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Types\">Resistant</a> to all non-magical damage.</li>\n<li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</li>\n<li>Becomes <a href=\"/wiki/Creature_Size\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Creature Size\">Tiny</a> in size.</li>\n<li>Cannot attack, cast spells, or speak.</li>\n<li>The target's Strength and Dexterity scores are set to 10 while in this form.</li>\n<li>Immune to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bleeding\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Bleeding_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bleeding_(Condition)\" title=\"Bleeding (Condition)\">Bleeding</a>.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201629\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.136 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.146 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5626/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 97921/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 25159/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.071/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1364112/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  120.040      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%  120.040      1 -total\n 51.93%   62.337      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 32.30%   38.778      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 24.79%   29.762      7 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 19.68%   23.623     16 Template:Icon_text\n 17.51%   21.019     54 Template:Trim\n 16.02%   19.235     12 Template:Icon_link\n 13.30%   15.960      2 Template:MdRarityItem\n 13.13%   15.757      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash: